{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06418","headline":"送山阴姚丞携妓之任兼寄苏少府 · 李颀","name":"送山阴姚丞携妓之任兼寄苏少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风香草路，南客心容与。\n白皙吴王孙，青蛾柳家女。\n都门数骑出，河口片帆举。\n夜簟眠橘洲，春衫傍枫屿。\n山阴政简甚从容，到罢惟求物外踪。\n落日花边剡溪水，晴烟竹里会稽峰。\n才子风流苏伯玉，同官晓暮应相逐。\n加飡共爱鲈鱼肥，醒酒仍怜甘蔗熟。\n知君练思本清新，季子如今得爲邻。\n他日知寻始宁墅，题诗早晚寄西人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}